gad2(){return"Only the owner can change roles. Open project settings, select the member\u2019s group and press the Role control on their card. Choose Admin, Normal or Limited, then press Save changes. You can also change the role while the account is pending confirmation."},
gad3(){return"The change applies to every group the person belongs to in that project. Moving them or adding them to another group in the same project preserves that role. Role changes take effect when you save; leaving without saving discards them."},
